[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 43 Hurry up!",
    "start": 0.75,
    "end": 4.492,
    "zh": "第43课 快点！",
    "zh_hant": "第43課 快點！"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 5.733,
    "end": 10.195,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "How do you know",
    "start": 11.276,
    "end": 12.816,
    "zh": "你怎么知道",
    "zh_hant": "你怎麼知道"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Sam doesn't make the tea very often?",
    "start": 12.596,
    "end": 16.538,
    "zh": "萨姆不经常泡茶呢？",
    "zh_hant": "薩姆不經常泡茶呢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Can you make the tea, Sam?",
    "start": 18.139,
    "end": 21.061,
    "zh": "萨姆，你能泡茶吗？",
    "zh_hant": "薩姆，你能泡茶嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Yes, of course I can, Penny.",
    "start": 22.161,
    "end": 25.603,
    "zh": "是的，我当然会，彭妮。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我當然會，彭妮。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Is there any water in this kettle?",
    "start": 27.284,
    "end": 30.245,
    "zh": "这个水壶里有水吗？",
    "zh_hant": "這個水壺裡有水嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Yes, there is.",
    "start": 31.046,
    "end": 32.927,
    "zh": "有，里面有。",
    "zh_hant": "有，裡面有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Where's the tea?",
    "start": 33.587,
    "end": 35.068,
    "zh": "茶叶在哪儿？",
    "zh_hant": "茶葉在哪兒？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "It's over there, behind the teapot.",
    "start": 35.348,
    "end": 39.31,
    "zh": "就在那边，茶壶后面。",
    "zh_hant": "就在那邊，茶壺後面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Can you see it?",
    "start": 40.911,
    "end": 42.471,
    "zh": "你能看见吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你能看見嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I can see the teapot,",
    "start": 43.672,
    "end": 46.094,
    "zh": "我能看见茶壶，",
    "zh_hant": "我能看見茶壺，"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "but I can't see the tea.",
    "start": 46.454,
    "end": 49.336,
    "zh": "但看不见茶叶。",
    "zh_hant": "但看不見茶葉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "There it is!",
    "start": 49.736,
    "end": 51.257,
    "zh": "在那儿呢！",
    "zh_hant": "在那兒呢！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "It's in front of you!",
    "start": 51.297,
    "end": 53.138,
    "zh": "就在你前面！",
    "zh_hant": "就在你前面！"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Ah yes, I can see it now.",
    "start": 53.578,
    "end": 57.761,
    "zh": "啊，是的，我现在看见了。",
    "zh_hant": "啊，是的，我現在看見了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Where are the cups?",
    "start": 58.742,
    "end": 60.602,
    "zh": "杯子在哪儿？",
    "zh_hant": "杯子在哪兒？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "There are some in the cupboard.",
    "start": 61.183,
    "end": 63.744,
    "zh": "橱柜里有一些。",
    "zh_hant": "櫥櫃裡有一些。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Can you find them?",
    "start": 64.025,
    "end": 65.866,
    "zh": "你能找到吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你能找到嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 66.326,
    "end": 67.326,
    "zh": "能。",
    "zh_hant": "能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Here they are.",
    "start": 67.107,
    "end": 68.687,
    "zh": "它们在这儿。",
    "zh_hant": "它們在這兒。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Hurry up, Sam!",
    "start": 69.128,
    "end": 70.829,
    "zh": "快点，萨姆！",
    "zh_hant": "快點，薩姆！"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "The kettle's boiling!",
    "start": 71.029,
    "end": 73.03,
    "zh": "水壶开了！",
    "zh_hant": "水壺開了！"
  }
]
